@host = http://localhost:17680
@leaveRequestId = 2039590995959435266
@taskId = 2039590996114624513

### 1. 初始化示例流程定义
POST {{host}}/warm-flow/demo/definition/init
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. 发起请假流程
POST {{host}}/warm-flow/demo/leave/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "u1001",
  "applicantName": "Chandler",
  "days": 3,
  "reason": "学习 Warm-Flow",
  "variables": {
    "department": "R&D"
  }
}

### 3. 根据业务ID查看请假单和待办
GET {{host}}/warm-flow/demo/leave/{{leaveRequestId}}

### 4. 主管审批通过
POST {{host}}/warm-flow/demo/task/pass
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": {{taskId}},
  "handler": "manager-001",
  "comment": "主管审批通过"
}

### 5. HR审批通过
POST {{host}}/warm-flow/demo/task/pass
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": {{taskId}},
  "handler": "hr-001",
  "comment": "HR审批通过"
}

### 6. 驳回示例
POST {{host}}/warm-flow/demo/task/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": {{taskId}},
  "handler": "manager-001",
  "comment": "资料不完整，驳回"
}
